---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="URI - Unbothered Resistance International"
  description="URI is the ground everything else is built on - faith, and justice as the restoration of right relationship. UNMASK and CHOICE are the frameworks that grow out of it."
  section="uri"
  accentColor="gold"
>

  <!-- ─── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[70vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 uri-gradient"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 30% 50%, rgba(107,33,168,0.2) 0%, transparent 60%), radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 80% 70%, rgba(217,119,6,0.12) 0%, transparent 55%);"></div>
    <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px] bg-gold"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl text-center lg:text-left">
        <span class="uri-tag mb-6 inline-flex mx-auto lg:mx-0 animate-on-scroll">
          Unbothered Resistance International
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-6xl text-light font-bold leading-tight mb-6 animate-on-scroll">
          The ground everything<br/>
          <span class="text-gold italic">else</span> grows from.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-muted text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 mb-10 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
          URI is the ground I build everything on - faith, and justice as the restoration of
          right relationship. What you'll actually see and experience are the frameworks that
          grow out of it: <span class="text-light font-semibold">UNMASK</span> and
          <span class="text-light font-semibold">CHOICE</span>.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
          <a href="#expressions" class="btn-gold">See Where This Shows Up</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ─── THE THREE CONCEPTS, KEPT SIMPLE ────────────── -->
  <section class="section-pad relative" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d0718 0%, #100820 100%);">
    <div class="container-mid">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="uri-tag mb-4 inline-flex">In Plain Terms</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl text-light">Three ideas. Nothing to book here.</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm">
          URI isn't a service and it isn't for sale. It's the test everything else has to pass.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        {[
          { icon: '⚓', label: 'Faith', desc: 'Rooted in womanist theology - Black women\'s experience as a source of wisdom, not just survival.' },
          { icon: '✊🏾', label: 'Justice', desc: 'Justice is the restoration of right relationship - with people, with structure, with Spirit.' },
          { icon: '🔍', label: 'Structure', desc: 'Power and systems examined honestly - not corporate management theory in different clothes.' },
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3 p-5 rounded-md border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition-colors bg-[#1a0b2e]">
            <span class="text-2xl">{item.icon}</span>
            <p class="font-heading text-light font-semibold text-sm">{item.label}</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-sm">{item.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ─── FRAMEWORKS FORMED HERE ─────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section-pad relative overflow-hidden" style="background: #100820;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 50% 40%, rgba(107,33,168,0.15) 0%, transparent 55%);"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="uri-tag mb-4 inline-flex">What's Grown From It</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl text-light">Two frameworks so far.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="card gold-hover animate-on-scroll">
          <span class="uri-tag text-xs mb-3 inline-flex">Framework</span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl text-light font-bold mb-3">UNMASK</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Born in BIWOC coaching. Names the architecture of structural burnout - language for
            what's happening, and why it was never a personal failing.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card gold-hover animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
          <span class="uri-tag text-xs mb-3 inline-flex">Framework</span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl text-light font-bold mb-3">CHOICE</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Names the conditions - mental, emotional, environmental - that shape what a person
            is actually free to choose, before anyone calls it a choice at all.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ─── WHERE THIS SHOWS UP (replaces Tiers + Vetting Form) ── -->
  <section id="expressions" class="section-pad relative overflow-hidden" style="background: #0d0718;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 50% 50%, rgba(107,33,168,0.07) 0%, transparent 65%);"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="uri-tag mb-4 inline-flex">Where This Shows Up</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl text-light">
          URI isn't booked directly. Its work is.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm">
          Three places URI's lens turns into something you can actually engage with.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="card gold-hover flex flex-col gap-4 animate-on-scroll">
          <span class="uri-tag text-xs mb-1 inline-flex">Speaking &amp; Training</span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-light font-bold">Strategic Transformations</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            Keynotes, workshops, cohorts, and organizational partnership work - UNMASK and URI's
            lens applied to leadership and structural burnout.
          </p>
          <a href="https://strategictransformations.net/structural-burnout/services" class="btn-outline-gold justify-center !text-sm">
            See Services
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card gold-hover flex flex-col gap-4 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
          <span class="uri-tag text-xs mb-1 inline-flex">Community Formation</span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-light font-bold">GWTC</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            CHOICE, taught communally through book club and group coaching - URI's lens applied
            to women processing choice and constraint together.
          </p>
          <span class="text-muted text-xs text-center pt-1">More on this soon</span>
        </div>

        <div class="card gold-hover flex flex-col gap-4 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
          <span class="uri-tag text-xs mb-1 inline-flex">In Formation</span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg text-light font-bold">The Structural Justice Institute</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            Research and public education - URI's lens applied to evidence, measurement, and
            public knowledge. Details will follow as its structure is finalized.
          </p>
          <span class="text-muted text-xs text-center pt-1">Launching soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 text-center animate-on-scroll">
        <p class="text-muted text-sm">Want to talk about a speaking or formation engagement?</p>
        <a href="https://calendar.app.google/e8ErMQqHhmnHn1hk6" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-gold mt-3 inline-flex">
          Book an Executive Briefing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
